{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tired of a meaningful career? Step into the soul-crushing world of office assistance!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Office Assistant</strong>, you play as the lowest-ranking hero of the corporate ecosystem. Armed with a mug of coffee and a suspiciously effective hammer, you'll tackle printer meltdowns, tangled cables, and an ever-growing pile of passive-aggressive emails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This light-hearted <strong>top-down office-life simulator</strong> offers a satirical take on modern work culture. With simple, one-button gameplay, you\u2019ll deliver equipment, fix IT problems, and try to stay caffeinated enough to survive another day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-Down Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Navigate office hallways, deliver tech gear, and fix stuff... sometimes violently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Button Simplicity</strong> \u2013 Hold to work. That\u2019s it. Like a real office job, only funnier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate Coffee Addiction</strong> \u2013 Grab a cup to boost your energy and get through the day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inbox from Hell</strong> \u2013 Deal with a never-ending stream of weird, useless, and sometimes plot-relevant emails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Discover</strong> \u2013 Unlock new areas, gather upgrades, and find strange office secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smash Printers with a Hammer</strong> \u2013 Because sometimes that <i>is</i> the fix.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Progression</strong> \u2013 Do your job well and rise through the ranks. Promotions not guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office &amp; Pop Culture Humor</strong> \u2013 Packed with references, dry wit, and the existential dread of fluorescent lighting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fix</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use sophisticated tools to maintain office equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897360/extras/bf87ccc276600d76be56b8196fca229a.poster.avif?t=1757183193\" width=776 height=698 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897360/extras/bf87ccc276600d76be56b8196fca229a.webm?t=1757183193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897360/extras/bf87ccc276600d76be56b8196fca229a.mp4?t=1757183193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explain</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the strength of calmness and patience to provide guidance and direction to your colleagues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897360/extras/1ea81b16bf00bd43ff3e4a8e12a69d8e.poster.avif?t=1757183193\" width=558 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897360/extras/1ea81b16bf00bd43ff3e4a8e12a69d8e.webm?t=1757183193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897360/extras/1ea81b16bf00bd43ff3e4a8e12a69d8e.mp4?t=1757183193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deliver</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly like the wind and grab the gear\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st